ven through time itself.\n\nThis puzzle-adventure responds to a single click or swipe, with intuitive puzzles that need only a little logic. The story is told with few words and a savagely funny streak. It is a single-player game from Daedalic Entertainment that suits casual adventure fans who like light puzzling and offbeat humor."}}